  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fire 704.03 Duration of Waiver. When a waiver is granted, it shall only be valid while the employee granted a waiver in Fire 704.01 is employed in that said position.\n\nSource #8647, eff 6-2-06; ss by #9319-B, eff 11-12-08, EXPIRED: 11-12-16\n\nNew. #12099, INTERIM, eff 2-2-17, EXPIRES: 8-1-17; ss by #12225-B, eff 6-28-17",
